Z||000003||Taijiguy||08-22-2000||09:39 AM||||Open Windows Explorer (Not Internet Explorer) and go to the "Windows" folder, then the "History" folder. In there you will see different time periods; 3 weeks ago, 2 weeks ago, 1 week ago, etc. Open the folder that coincides with the time period when you visited the site, and then open the folder that coincides with the site you visited. Then let us know the site name!<BR>Email me if you need more info. This won't work if you clear your history though.<P>-Taiji||||reg||1
